From c7d626ce9aca90e58f93934518390d760e8d90b1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cizar-szymon <szymon@cs-lab.eu>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 19:54:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] 0.118: options and mouse of the original, LAN lobby, sync
 error save and resync

- Options - Video: Pathway scrolling (the map follows the end of a road, as
  far as needed), Fast mapclick (a right double click opens the map window),
  Fast building (a double click on a site opens the building window, sets a
  flag where only a flag fits, starts a road on an own flag; the map alone)
- The building sites of the panel show the sites for a flag alone; they
  switch with the left button while the right one is held
- Left click with the right button held (Event::ButtonBoth): the window of
  a building, demolishing; the right button alone and the key 2 do not
  demolish; the right button does not close the building window
- A double click on a tree stump opens the building window
- A demolished building without a road takes its flag
- Map sizes 1 and 2; the size kept after a game and in the settings
- The map window keeps its choices; Autosave 3 and 5 min
- Load game: a wide list, no map preview; the Save Game box 2.5 times as
  wide; quick saves with names that fit an Amiga disk (30 letters)
- LAN: a lobby after connecting (the server chooses the map, both see its
  preview, chat, quick answers); a new map keeps the players; Show ping
  in LAN game; a save when the game ends (LAN_ERR_...); out of step: a
  save of both sides (SYNC_ERR_...) and a resync (the server's game to the
  other side, Ctrl+Shift+R); LANTEST Ctrl+Shift+X makes a game go apart

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01J7U35RuKvTQMs84jNJEFhT
